  "releaseNotes": "Numeric cells in dynamic parsing now come back as int/decimal instead of strings. Integer-formatted cells with fractional values fall back to decimal so no precision is lost. Typed parsing via Convert.ChangeType now uses InvariantCulture so decimals work on non-en machines. BREAKING for dynamic consumers casting numeric properties to string — switch to (int)/(decimal) or Convert.ToString.",
